    },
    "fixed_source": "Both source-failure regressions pass under race. Coverage includes deferred callback exit, sticky failure, source called once, safe error without panic payload, pre-captured and later read/write/relation/aggregate/join/subquery compilation with empty statements, and repeated read/count/cursor/chunk/relation/aggregate execution with zero recorded SQL.",
    "initial_test_correction": "The first owner regression placed a second Get behind sync.Once before synctest.Wait; mutex waits are not durably blocked, so the test stalled. Its goroutine stack confirmed the test barrier mistake; that process was stopped and the redundant concurrent waiter was removed. The corrected focused race test passed. Production source did not change."
